        <p>Sold in the neighbourhood by .T. R. YOUNG, &amp;mum STR ' ISZT WARRINGTON, by the execntore of the late ISAAC SPEAKMAN, BRIDGE•STRBET, PHARMACY, RUN- CORN ; J. H. WESTON,DENT,Nemas BUILDING, RUNCORN; S. STRINGFELLOW, 1 COLLEGE-STREET, ST. HELENS ; MEssne. HEATH AND LEEOHAM ; arid by E. 1300fH, 5, CHESTER BRIDGE, CREWE.</p>
